    {
      "text": "Forest plot of Nipro PZA LPA sensitivity and specificity for PZA resistance in seven studies: Ando, Burhan trial, Driesen, Matsumoto, Mitarai, Rienthong and Sekiguchi. Each row gives a study's TP, FP, FN and TN counts and sensitivity and specificity with 95% CI, plotted as squares with CI lines on 0–1 scales. Sensitivity ranges from 0.36 (Rienthong) and 0.39 (Burhan trial) to 1.00; specificity is 0.93–1.00.",
